          "author": "Tales From the Cloud Sea",
          "description": "When Amelia and Arthur discover a secret in the attic, they're transported to a parallel world of sky islands, pirate airships, steam-powered robots, and lots of laughs. TALES FROM THE CLOUD SEA is made up on the spot—no script, no plan, no rules! The best part is, kids from Earth (you!) decide where The Skytanic sails next. Join Amelia, Arthur, Captain Squidhand, first-mate Dobbins, their adorable robot Cranklin, and the strange sky island denizens on a quest for massive booty (treasure!) and the secrets of The Cloud Sea. \n\nLeave a voicemail for Cranklin: (256)-834-5394 or CLOUD-4-KEY-4",
